---
import Layout from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---
<Layout>
<main class="signature"><p class="eyebrow">PERSONALISATION / 02</p><h1>Make it<br /><i>yours.</i></h1><p class="intro">A discreet signature, monogram or name can become part of the emblem — subtle enough to discover, personal enough to keep.</p><div class="preview"><div class="disc">◉<small>YOUR<br />MARK</small></div><div class="form"><label>YOUR NAME<input placeholder="Alex" /></label><label>STYLE<select><option>Connected script</option><option>Minimal monogram</option><option>Classic serif</option></select></label><label>PLACEMENT<select><option>Lower edge</option><option>Centre</option><option>Outer ring</option></select></label><button>PREVIEW YOUR EMBLEM ↗</button></div></div></main>
</Layout>
<style>
:global(body){background:#181818;color:#f3f1eb;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif}.signature{padding:12vw 8vw}.eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;opacity:.55}.signature h1{font-size:clamp(65px,10vw,145px);font-weight:400;line-height:.8;letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:75px 0 35px}.signature h1 i{font-family:Georgia,serif}.intro{max-width:510px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.5;opacity:.6}.preview{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10vw;align-items:center;margin-top:100px}.disc{width:min(38vw,450px);aspect-ratio:1;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:radial-gradient(circle,#666,#222 60%,#090909);box-shadow:0 20px 80px #000,inset 0 0 0 1px #b99a67;font-size:9rem;color:#d0ad72;position:relative}.disc small{position:absolute;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-align:center;color:#fff;opacity:.7}.form{border-top:1px solid #555}.form label{display:block;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.15em;padding:25px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #555}.form input,.form select{display:block;width:100%;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #777;background:transparent;color:#fff;padding:16px 0;font-size:18px;margin-top:8px}.form button{margin-top:35px;background:transparent;color:#fff;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #fff;padding:16px 0;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.16em}@media(max-width:700px){.preview{grid-template-columns:1fr}.disc{width:75vw}}
</style>